If ansible can 'remote start' nImOlauncher, record a setup as an ansible playbook, complete with command-line options.\
Each nImOlauncher needs to record what it has launched\'85 and replies to a request for the sequence so that it can be 'replayed'.\
Note that each nImO service remembers its launch parameters, but not where it is running - nImOlauncher is responsible for 'remote launch' of services.\
